#. de: Die Soldaten in Ok' Vundo Vana angreifen
#. fr: Abattre des soldats impériaux
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/019/HeaVnz712_01916:TEXT_HEAVNZ712_01916_TODO_06:1"
msgid "Slay imperial soldiers."
msgstr ""

